    "body": "Crates.io does not currently display a privacy notice, and I am concerned that crates.io may be operating in violation of data protection legislation in the EU (and elsewhere).\r\n \r\nA privacy notice should be added so that people know what data is collected about them when they use the crates.io website (I see that Google Analytics is used, for example, (see #460) with no notification to users that their personal data is being processed.) and/or use cargo to fetch crates listed by the service.",
